WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Rehearse before execute — A degraded UAV still has a choice.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
One state. Three virtual futures. — Move trial execution into the digital twin.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Recorded rehearsal and execution — Estimated event alignment · shared timeline · identical 0.5x playback

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
A shared normal-dynamics evaluator — Learn nominal behaviour. Freeze. Compare.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Reference and consequences work together — J = nominal cost + severity consistency + action bias.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
RQ1 · Does the twin represent flight? — Compare responses and distributions.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
RQ2 · How does evidence affect selection? — 189 replay records · 9 degradation scenarios.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Physical candidate execution — Return and Land · action-relative video and logged height

00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Observe → rehearse → evaluate → execute — Inspect consequences before choosing a response.
